  <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://eo4society.esa.int/projects/opensr/">‘Explainable
  AI: Application to Trustworthy Super-Resolution (OpenSR)’</ext-link>
  Project.</p>
</sec>
</body>
